{
  "about": "Color themes. \"theme\" picks the active one; View > Theme switches between them. \"base\" is the FlatLaf look (dark or light). \"flatlaf\" passes keys straight to FlatLaf: variables like @background, @foreground and @accentColor, or any UI key such as Button.arc. \"colors\" are the app's own colors (#rrggbb or #rrggbbaa). \"icons\" are the colors for the letters in icons.json.",
